        "Name": "Quiver of Prismatic Strikes",
        "Notes": "TYPE: Elemental ammunition supply<br><br>PHYSICAL: Leather quiver with crystalline inlays. Interior shimmers with contained elemental energy. Arrows within have crystallized elemental tips.<br><br>PROPERTIES:<br>• Holds 20 arrows that regenerate at dawn<br>• User chooses damage type when drawing each arrow: Fire, Cold, Lightning, or Acid<br>• +1d6 elemental damage of chosen type<br>• Arrows count as magical<br>• Tips reform if arrow is recovered<br><br>ORIGIN: Acquired from Raazalkul's hoard.<br><br>STATUS: Stored in vault. Solid ranged support item.<br><br>POTENTIAL USES: Give to archer ally, equip Bloodaxe Legion scout commander, or use as trade goods/diplomatic gift.",
