        "Location": "Worn by Helvraen",
        "Name": "Brooch of Undisturbed Transactions",
        "Notes": "PHYSICAL: Small gem-inlaid silver brooch with invisible sigils on metal backing (visible only to enhanced perception). Understated quality craftsmanship.<br><br>OVERT FUNCTION:<br>• Protection against theft (minor abjuration)<br>• Alerts wearer to unauthorized proximity to merchandise<br><br>COVERT FUNCTION:<br>• Merchant soul fragments absorb impressions of significant magical sales<br>• Stores info about rare components, unusual buyers, exceptional items<br>• Periodic impressions delivered to Arik during meditation<br>• Subliminal influence encouraging interest in planar components and soul-affecting items<br><br>CREATED: Session 7 as gift to Helvraen. Incorporates merchant soul fragments from Ghohlbrorn Consortium operation and minuscule illithid consciousness for subliminal suggestions.<br><br>PURPOSE: Extends Arik's intelligence network into commercial sector. Reshapes Helvraen's inventory toward useful merchandise. No direct magical link that might trigger detection.",
